00:37:44.159 --> 00:37:46.159
Beze Sha'ar HaShavayim

00:37:46.159 --> 00:37:48.159
Beze Sha'ar HaShavayim

00:37:48.159 --> 00:37:50.159
Sha'ar HaShavayim

00:37:50.159 --> 00:37:52.159
So you enter the Bet HaMikdash

00:37:52.159 --> 00:37:54.159
and you are in heaven.

00:37:54.159 --> 00:37:56.159
And therefore we believe

00:37:56.159 --> 00:37:58.159
that if you pray

00:37:58.159 --> 00:38:00.159
there in the Bet HaMikdash

00:38:00.159 --> 00:38:02.159
that's why it's important for us

00:38:02.159 --> 00:38:04.159
the Bet HaMikdash

00:38:04.159 --> 00:38:06.159
So if you

00:38:06.159 --> 00:38:08.159
